    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαρμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαίρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>something raised, a swelling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀγγείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν φολίδων ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					3.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>elation, vanity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τύχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotad.
					9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> in good sense,
				<i>elevation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσον ἔ. ψυχὴ λαμβάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				21.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>height,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Es.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>.</div>
